></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea8 Warning: This game will test your patience.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage quits expected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendships may be lost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you make it to the top\u2026</p></li></ul>",
